Q: helper is not loading in Codeigniter model A: <p>According to the documentation</p>
<blockquote>
<p><code>$this-&gt;load-&gt;helper('name');</code></p>
<p>Where name is the file name of the helper, <strong>without</strong> the .php file extension or the “helper” part.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>which means the following code should work</p>
<pre><code>class  MyModel extends CI_Model 
{
    public function loadData()
    {
        $this-&gt;load-&gt;helper('data');
        loaditems();
    }
}
</code></pre>
<p>you can read more about it <a href="https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/general/helpers.html" rel="nofollow noreferrer">here</a></p>
